Rudy Giuliani and Sidney Powell, two of Donald&nbsp;
Trump's former election fraud attorneys, although&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:19.360
to call them election fraud attorneys, suggests&nbsp;
that there might have been fraud, which we now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:26.720
know there wasn't. But both Rudy and Sidney have&nbsp;
been subpoenaed by the Trump Riot Committee, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:33.760
House Committee investigating the Jan. six Trump&nbsp;
riots. This is very bad news for them and very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:39.680
bad news for Trump and Sidney Powell has not been&nbsp;
having an easy go of it. Newsweek reporting Rudy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:46.240
and Sydney subpoenaed by one six committee. Will&nbsp;
they comply? The House Committee investigating&nbsp;&nbsp;

