the Jan. six riot has subpoenaed Rudy Giuliani,&nbsp;
Jenna Ellis, Sidney Powell and Boris Epshteyn,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.240
all attorneys in the 2020 reelection campaign&nbsp;
of then-President Trump. It's unclear whether&nbsp;&nbsp;

