have not. Some have invoked the Fifth Amendment to&nbsp;
avoid testifying. The committee wrote in a Tuesday&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:17.280
evening tweet the four individuals advanced&nbsp;
unsupported theories about election fraud pushed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:23.920
efforts to overturn election results or were in&nbsp;
direct contact with the former president. The Hill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:31.600
likewise reporting on these subpoenas, saying that&nbsp;
the subpoena goes after the core of Trump's legal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:37.360
team after the November 3rd election, a group&nbsp;
that prepared legal arguments following his loss&nbsp;&nbsp;

