work pushing fraud claims on TV and in courtrooms,&nbsp;
the committee wrote. You actively promoted claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:20.320
of election fraud on behalf of former President&nbsp;
Trump and sought to convince state legislators&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:29.600
to take steps to overturn the election. Ana&nbsp;
Cabrera from CNN reports that her that Sidney&nbsp;&nbsp;

