that Powell also still believes there indeed was&nbsp;
election fraud. So this is potentially a really,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:49.840
really big deal, and there's a few different&nbsp;
pieces to this that I think are important.&nbsp;&nbsp;

